 Proficiency in Large Language Models.<br />- Strong understanding of cloud computing platforms and services.<br />- Experience with deep learning frameworks such as TensorFlow or PyTorch.<br />- Familiarity with natural language processing techniques and tools.<br />- Ability to design and implement scalable AI solutions.<br /> <br />Additional Information: <br />- The candidate should have minimum 5 years of experience in Large Language Models.<br />- This position is based in Pune.<br />- A 15 years full time education is required.<br /> <br />
